{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/e38b2bfe3f0c207684f255834c6523f2.avif?t=1759527198\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1865. The fires of the Civil War have died down and America is once again expanding westwards. The Wild West is a frontier where everyone lives and dies by the gun. You are the captain of a squad of government soldiers sent to bring law and order, to hunt down the bandits and robbers that plague honest folks just trying to make a living out west\u00a0 - and unknowingly step into a much larger fight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by spaghetti western classics, A Fistful of Yankees is a real-time strategy game set in the heyday of the Wild West. Lead a squad of Yankee soldiers into cinematic fights with bandits, navigate treacherous badlands, and unravel a devious plot straight out of a Western comic book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/94ecd525d74a8cd062bb834ac6b94fe4.avif?t=1759527198\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West: Experience the iconic period of American history in a unique spaghetti western, with a revolver in hand and a squad of Yankees at your back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/e789b70b36fe4e4894f7dd327617a835.poster.avif?t=1759527198\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/e789b70b36fe4e4894f7dd327617a835.webm?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/e789b70b36fe4e4894f7dd327617a835.mp4?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Tactical Gunfights: There are no duels on the lawless frontier. Find cover for your soldiers, set up chokepoints, and use clever tactics and special abilities to overcome your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/333d563394314aa902cba0bf79ad684b.poster.avif?t=1759527198\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/333d563394314aa902cba0bf79ad684b.webm?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/333d563394314aa902cba0bf79ad684b.mp4?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontier Management: You're a long way from home out west and wagon trains are few. Wisely manage your soldiers and prestige earned - or be prepared to go out like Custer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/c66c29a38fb0aa18cd24f55054545921.poster.avif?t=1759527198\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/c66c29a38fb0aa18cd24f55054545921.webm?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/c66c29a38fb0aa18cd24f55054545921.mp4?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling Campaign: Fighting under the Stars and Stripes will take you from arid badlands to lush Northwoods, following the trail of a cruel plot hatched by an even worse kind of robber than the usual bandits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/db32938eec7c3f9bfd6afe8a3bee420e.poster.avif?t=1759527198\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/db32938eec7c3f9bfd6afe8a3bee420e.webm?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/db32938eec7c3f9bfd6afe8a3bee420e.mp4?t=1759527198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2936470?t=1759527198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759527198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/fd36607ed4ec631ba273ed450debf175fd6a7aee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759527198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/fd36607ed4ec631ba273ed450debf175fd6a7aee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759527198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936470/extras/e38b2bfe3f0c207684f255834c6